Date: Mon, 18 May 2020 16:40:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] DRV_DPM_SW-221: FLM DPM fix issue on adding end-to-end qos
 link

- fix dp_link_set() to always set parent arbitration
- refactor dp_link_add_31()
- fix qos debugfs add_q cmd
---
